{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2022-07-27 06:00:00', 'title': 'WEST ELECTS NEW DIRECTOR TO THE BOARD', 'text': "EXTON, PA. , JULY 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES, INC.\xa0(NYSE: WST), A GLOBAL LEADER IN INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS FOR INJECTABLE DRUG ADMINISTRATION, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED\xa0STEPHEN LOCKHART, M.D., PH.D., AS ITS NEWEST MEMBER."}